---
import Prose from "../components/Prose.astro";
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  theme="light"
  title="Privacy — ScientFactory"
  description="How ScientFactory handles website, Desktop analytics, phone app and Scient Connect information."
>
  <Prose
    eyebrow="Last updated 12 November 2026"
    title="Privacy, plainly stated."
    intro="This notice covers the ScientFactory website, analytics in Scient Desktop, the Scient phone app and the optional Scient Connect service."
  >
    <section class="content-section" aria-labelledby="privacy-analytics">
      <p class="content-section__label">Website analytics</p>
      <div class="content-section__body">
        <h2 id="privacy-analytics">Website analytics</h2>
        <p>
          We collect website usage, device and network information to understand how people find and start using Scient, measure downloads and improve the service.
        </p>
        <p>
          Optional analytics cookies help us recognize returning visits. You can change your choice through <strong>Cookie settings</strong> in the footer. Event counts and network information are still recorded without these cookies.
        </p>
        <p>
          We do not use advertising trackers, cross-site tracking or session recording on this website.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="content-section" aria-labelledby="privacy-app">
      <p class="content-section__label">Scient Desktop</p>
      <div class="content-section__body">
        <h2 id="privacy-app">Scient Desktop</h2>
        <p>
          Scient collects usage, reliability, account, device and network information to understand how people use the app and improve it. This includes which features, agents and models are used and whether they work as expected.
        </p>
        <p>
          Where available, account information includes provider sign-in emails and reported plans. Device and network information helps us associate installations and understand where the app is used. You may also optionally tell us about your work, field and role, or skip these questions.
        </p>
        <p>
          Our analytics do not collect your prompts, conversations, files, research results, passwords, API keys or access tokens. Connected AI services receive the requests and supporting context needed to provide their services under their own terms and privacy policies.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="content-section" aria-labelledby="privacy-connect">
      <p class="content-section__label">Scient Connect</p>
      <div class="content-section__body">
        <h2 id="privacy-connect">Reach your own computers, only if you turn it on.</h2>
        <p>
          Scient Connect is optional and off until you sign in. To link your computers, we keep your account and the name and address of each computer you link. Your conversations and files travel encrypted between your devices through Cloudflare; we don't see or store them. We keep short technical logs for 30 days to fix problems.
        </p>
        <p>
          We use Clerk for sign-in, and Cloudflare, PlanetScale and Axiom to run the service.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="content-section" aria-labelledby="privacy-phone">
      <p class="content-section__label">Scient phone app</p>
      <div class="content-section__body">
        <h2 id="privacy-phone">Scient phone app</h2>
        <p>
          You can pair the phone app directly with your computer, or sign in to use Scient Connect. When you sign in, we receive your account email and user ID through Clerk.
        </p>
        <p>
          To deliver notifications, Live Activities and widgets, we keep a random ID for your phone, its name, its operating system and app version, its notification tokens, and the project and conversation titles and short status lines those notifications show. Apple and Google carry the notifications. The latest status shown on your phone is kept until a newer one replaces it or you remove the phone or your account; notification delivery records are kept for 7 days.
        </p>
        <p>
          The app sends error reports (error message, stack trace, app version, device model and operating system) and startup timings with a random ID that isn't tied to your account; you can turn them off in the app's Diagnostics settings. Requests to Scient Connect are also traced, and those traces are linked to your account. Diagnostics and logs are kept for 30 days. The app has no advertising or analytics trackers.
        </p>
        <p>
          Your conversations and files travel between the phone and your own computers, and we don't store them. Through Scient Connect they are encrypted. A direct connection is encrypted when your computer's address uses HTTPS or a private network such as a tailnet; a plain <code>http://</code> address on a local network is not encrypted.
        </p>
        <p>
          Voice dictation runs on the phone, or on your own computer with the speech service you choose there. On Android, Google's on-device speech component (ML Kit) sends Google device and app information, identifiers and diagnostics under Google's terms.
        </p>
        <p>
          Deleting your account in the app removes your account, linked computers, phone registrations and notification records right away. <a href="/support#support-delete">What account deletion removes</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="content-section" aria-labelledby="privacy-storage">
      <p class="content-section__label">Storage and retention</p>
      <div class="content-section__body">
        <h2 id="privacy-storage">Storage and retention</h2>
        <p>
          Website and Desktop analytics are stored in ScientFactory's Cloudflare database. Ordinary usage information may also be processed in our EU-hosted PostHog project. Account details, optional work-profile answers, device identifiers and network observations stay in Cloudflare and are excluded from those exports.
        </p>
        <p>
          Detailed installation usage is retained while the installation remains active and for two years after its last activity. Diagnostic and failure records expire after 60 days. Aggregate totals without personal identifiers may be retained indefinitely.
        </p>
        <p>
          Verified installation-deletion requests remove that installation's detailed records. Aggregate totals and a minimal record needed to prevent deleted data from being recreated may remain.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>


    <section class="content-section" aria-labelledby="privacy-hosting">
      <p class="content-section__label">Hosting and downloads</p>
      <div class="content-section__body">
        <h2 id="privacy-hosting">Hosting and downloads</h2>
        <p>
          Cloudflare delivers the website and may process standard request information to operate, secure and troubleshoot the service.
        </p>
        <p>
          Installers are served by GitHub under its own privacy terms. Our website records download clicks and failures in its redirect service; it cannot observe a later transfer failure after GitHub starts serving the file.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="content-section" aria-labelledby="privacy-contact">
      <p class="content-section__label">Contact</p>
      <div class="content-section__body">
        <h2 id="privacy-contact">Contact</h2>
        <p>
          ScientFactory and Scient are operated by GENORE PREV LTD, an Israeli company (company number 516936846).
        </p>
        <p>
          For questions about your data, or to ask us to delete your Scient account, email <a href="mailto:support@scientfactory.com">support@scientfactory.com</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </Prose>
</Layout>
